  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A spike in legislative and public oversight (hearings, subpoenas, public investigations) produces competing public disclosures and partisan framing by multiple actors, generating inconsistent and muddled policy messages from the U.S. policymaking system.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">us_political_realign</data>
