  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.66</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in high-profile cyber breaches linked to the conflict forces staggered, agency-specific public disclosures and competing guidance (security, commerce, intelligence), producing conflicting messages and reduced coherence in official policy signaling.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
