  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Disruptions to semiconductor and hardware supply chains cause production delays and downward guidance at AI and hardware firms, leading investors to mark down valuations and dampen tech‑sector sentiment.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
