  <data key="d36">0.66</data>
  <data key="d37">War-driven interruptions to shipping and component availability lead Gulf regulators and port authorities to tighten customs inspections, impose new export‑control checks and stricter licensing on transshipment routes, increasing regulatory burdens on logistics and trade firms.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
