  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Unclear near-term export controls, investment limits and data rules tied to US–China rivalry raise firm and investor risk perceptions about AI and data-dependent businesses, depressing sector sentiment.</data>
