  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Visible expansion of agency scrutiny and rulemaking on AI/data use raises firms' expectations of novel compliance obligations and ambiguous enforcement standards, increasing perceived unpredictability about future regulation.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_data_backlash</data>
  <data key="d40">us_political_realign</data>
