  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Intense, fast‑moving scandal coverage pressures multiple agencies and political actors to issue reactive, sometimes contradictory statements and interim measures, degrading the consistency of official policy signals.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_data_backlash</data>
  <data key="d40">us_political_realign</data>
