  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising domestic regulatory uncertainty tied to political realignment prompts agencies and Congressional committees to open new investigations and enforcement actions focused on technology firms (including those with China links), increasing scrutiny intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_realign</data>
