  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.68</data>
  <data key="d37">Greater volatility and retrenchment in cross-border capital flows directly reduces available funding and increases financing costs for AI startups and listed tech firms, depressing sector-specific investor sentiment.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_realign</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_data_backlash</data>
</edge>
