  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Spikes in cross-border capital-flow volatility accelerate portfolio withdrawals and widen risk premia for assets exposed to US–China ties, directly reducing investor willingness to take on bilateral-market risk and lowering confidence.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_realign</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
